# Local machine only.
#
# This page carries the seeded test-account passwords and drives the portal as
# each role, so it must never be reachable from another host. The parent
# .htaccess exempts this folder from the blanket /tools/ 404 precisely so it can
# be opened in a browser; this file is what keeps that exemption safe.
#
# Development tooling. Do not ship it.
Require local
